WC(1)

NAME
     wc - count lines, words and characters

SYNOPSIS
     wc [-lwc] [file ...]

DESCRIPTION
     Counts the lines, words and characters in its input, in that
     order. -l prints only the lines, -w only the words, -c only the
     characters.

EXAMPLES
     wc -l /usr/adm/usage.log
     grep marge /usr/adm/usage.log | wc -l
